#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD9708 expect=skipped domain=TI
# Rule:Description: PMDA-SD9708 — the Required key IETESTCD is not populated.
#note "IETESTCD is absent from TI, so Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule to SKIPPED rather than firing on every row. This is the absent-column guard the standing 'absent column = all-missing column' policy makes necessary: without it empty(IETESTCD) would be true on every row of every dataset that simply lacks the column. Asserts the SKIP, not merely the absence of a finding."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TI
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col IETEST type=Char
col IECAT type=Char
---
S1      | TI     | Age 18 years or older | INCLUSION
---
